>n</italic>=22). (<italic>p</italic>-value for the full model=0.38; d.f.=47.)</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th valign="bottom" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">explanatory variable</th><th valign="bottom" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">deviance</th><th valign="bottom" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">difference</th><th valign="bottom" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic>p</italic></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">constant</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">69.74</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">relative forest loss</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">61.52</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">8.21</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.004</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">distance to our traps</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">53.24</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">8.28</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.004</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">past commonness</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">49.24</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">4.00</td><td align="char" char="." rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.046</td></tr></tbody></table></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>